# Base URL of the backend API.
#
# NOTE the name: the code reads VITE_API_URL. The README used to say VITE_BACKEND_URL, which
# is wrong - setting that one leaves the code reading `undefined` and every request goes to
# "undefined/api/..." which the browser treats as a relative path. Corrected 2026-08-23.
#
# Vite only exposes variables starting with VITE_ to the browser, and it reads this file
# ONLY at dev-server startup - restart `npm run dev` after changing it.
#
# Local:      http://localhost:5000
# Production: your Render URL, e.g. https://cortex-g17y.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
